string_permutation_checker
==========================

Write a function:

    def string_permutation_checker(str1: str, str2: str) -> bool

Return True if `str1` and `str2` are ANAGRAMS of one another, ignoring
spaces and letter case.

Examples:
    string_permutation_checker("listen", "silent")            -> True
    string_permutation_checker("Astronomer", "Moon starer")   -> True
    string_permutation_checker("hello", "world")              -> False
    string_permutation_checker("a", "A")                      -> True
